{"4902600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Re:Store the Record Store", "steam_appid": 4902600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4902600/extras/cbddf6446b19f1b49a4aa45d2d034bcc.avif?t=1787227218\" width=388 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jack's monkey has escaped holdings and has thrashed the store. Now he needs you to sleeve all the vinyl records into their jackets and then restored back to their correct musical genre's storage crates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The monkey (named after Jack himself) got his hands on all 20 genres of vinyl records, and has tossed hundreds of vinyl records and their jackets all over the place!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4902600/extras/901f6721f1ae43288edc554ca47bce3f.avif?t=1787227218\" width=1331 height=837 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Re:Store the Record Store is an atmospheric sorting game set in a cozy indie vinyl record store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4902600/extras/0a40503c824e4684290e09b125145c4d.avif?t=1787227218\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4902600/extras_big/0a40503c824e4684290e09b125145c4d.webp?t=1787227218 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring over 1000 vinyl records and jackets to pick up, sleeve and resorted back into the crates where they belong! A day-night cycle alters the shop's atmosphere. Take your time sorting and storing the records! It's not a game to rush through. Or you could if you want to, with abilities such as Genre Glance, Crate Chaser and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4902600/extras/1b26e37a65fadc78927266f0ca71c6a8.avif?t=1787227218\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4902600/extras_big/1b26e37a65fadc78927266f0ca71c6a8.webp?t=1787227218 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up vinyl records and jackets in first person perspective, slide the vinyl satisfyingly into the correct jacket and then put them back into crates. Made a mistake? You can extract the sleeved vinyl as well!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4902600/extras/83a79d96af20fe35d12712588e6ac270.avif?t=1787227218\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4902600/extras_big/83a79d96af20fe35d12712588e6ac270.webp?t=1787227218 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zen Sorting Gameplay:</strong> Over 1000 objects to wade and sort through! Get them all back where they belong with no time limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Humorous Details:</strong> Discover punny artist and album names. Every single album's artist name, album name, and jacket art are hand crafted to be as silly or as cool as possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive objects:</strong> There's a cool looking gramophone on the counter top! It must have been placed there for a reason.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden secrets:</strong> The game doesn't end at sorting all the vinyl records, there are additional things to do to get Steam achievements. What are they? You're gonna have to play and find out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4902600/extras/f9412fa3eaaa1c4ca2f5ab7a491887a2.avif?t=1787227218\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4902600/extras_big/f9412fa3eaaa1c4ca2f5ab7a491887a2.avif?t=1787227218 width=1560 height=876 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4902600/extras/cbddf6446b19f1b49a4aa45d2d034bcc.avif?t=1787227218\" width=388 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jack's monkey has escaped holdings and has thrashed the store. Now he needs you to sleeve all the vinyl records into their jackets and then restored back to their correct musical genre's storage crates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The monkey (named after Jack himself) got his hands on all 20 genres of vinyl records, and has tossed hundreds of vinyl records and their jackets all over the place!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4902600/extras/901f6721f1ae43288edc554ca47bce3f.avif?t=1787227218\" width=1331 height=837 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Re:Store the Record Store is an atmospheric sorting game set in a cozy indie vinyl record store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4902600/extras/0a40503c824e4684290e09b125145c4d.avif?t=1787227218\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4902600/extras_big/0a40503c824e4684290e09b125145c4d.webp?t=1787227218 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring over 1000 vinyl records and jackets to pick up, sleeve and resorted back into the crates where they belong! A day-night cycle alters the shop's atmosphere. Take your time sorting and storing the records! It's not a game to rush through. Or you could if you want to, with abilities such as Genre Glance, Crate Chaser and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4902600/extras/1b26e37a65fadc78927266f0ca71c6a8.avif?t=1787227218\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4902600/extras_big/1b26e37a65fadc78927266f0ca71c6a8.webp?t=1787227218 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up vinyl records and jackets in first person perspective, slide the vinyl satisfyingly into the correct jacket and then put them back into crates. Made a mistake? You can extract the sleeved vinyl as well!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4902600/extras/83a79d96af20fe35d12712588e6ac270.avif?t=1787227218\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4902600/extras_big/83a79d96af20fe35d12712588e6ac270.webp?t=1787227218 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zen Sorting Gameplay:</strong> Over 1000 objects to wade and sort through! Get them all back where they belong with no time limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Humorous Details:</strong> Discover punny artist and album names. Every single album's artist name, album name, and jacket art are hand crafted to be as silly or as cool as possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive objects:</strong> There's a cool looking gramophone on the counter top! It must have been placed there for a reason.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden secrets:</strong> The game doesn't end at sorting all the vinyl records, there are additional things to do to get Steam achievements. What are they? You're gonna have to play and find out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4902600/extras/f9412fa3eaaa1c4ca2f5ab7a491887a2.avif?t=1787227218\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4902600/extras_big/f9412fa3eaaa1c4ca2f5ab7a491887a2.avif?t=1787227218 width=1560 height=876 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Re:Store the Record Store is a game about tidying up an indie record store after the owner had to run off to chase down his escaped monkey. Featuring over 1000 items to pick up, sort through and return back into the crates where they belong. Take your time to look through everything or speedrun it!", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4902600/2fb53b6bb8040cdbaac71f1b60f8ce61c9f9fb8c/header.jpg?t=1787227218", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4902600/b05343cd670ae2cd54f8fa7e6e49962e2f81db11/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787227218", "capsule_imagev5": "ht